OL,3,GNEWSANI secretary to ban the Drumcree
OL,4,Aparade
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorthern Ireland Secretary Sir Chris
OL,7,FBryant has said he will ban the
OL,8,Fcontentious Orange Order parade at
OL,9,FDrumcree.
OL,11,FThe dispute has led to a stand-off
OL,12,Fbetween Orangemen and nationalist
OL,13,Fresidents of the Garvaghy Road in
OL,14,FPortadown lasting almost two weeks.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,412,410,260,120,0,100
