OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSANI secretary to ban the Drumcree
OL,4,Aparade
OL,5,
OL,6,FSir Chris said the Police Service of
OL,7,FNorthern Ireland (PSNI) chief constable
OL,8,Fadvised him "that it would not be
OL,9,Fpossible to enable the procession to
OL,10,Fhappen without a major intervention
OL,11,Fwhich would carry an unacceptable risk
OL,12,Fof serious injury, disorder and a wider
OL,13,Fcontagion effect across Northern
OL,14,FIreland".
OL,16,FThe move comes on the 13th day of
OL,17,Fdeadlock between residents and the
OL,18,Flocal district lodge of the Orange
OL,19,FOrder.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
